OL,3,GNEWSAThieves steal two lorries full of
OL,4,AGuinness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen more than 800
OL,7,Fbarrels of Guinness by driving off from
OL,8,Fa depot with two HGV trailers.
OL,10,FAbout 70,000 pints worth of the stout,
OL,11,Festimated to be worth #115,000, were
OL,12,Ftaken from Whitehouse Industrial Estate
OL,13,Fon Aston Lane in Runcorn on Monday,
OL,14,FCheshire Police said.
OL,16,FOne wagon-load was taken at about 19:45
OL,17,FBST and a second one was stolen at
OL,18,Fabout 21:30.
OL,20,FThe stolen barrels - which each would
OL,21,Fhold about 88 pints - had been destined
OL,22,Ffor pubs, the force added.
